# On-prem store hosts

**Canonical inventory:** [`docs/technical/on-prem-store-hosts.zh.md`](../../docs/technical/on-prem-store-hosts.zh.md).

Before any store `scp` / SSH / upgrade staging:

1. Read that table; select the store by name.
2. If Will did not name the store → **ask** (do not default to Pirata).
3. **Never** commit Linux/SSH/web passwords into the repo. Local secrets only in Agent personal store `on-prem-store-credentials.md`.
4. Still do **not** run `sudo upgrade.sh` on the store unless Will explicitly asks in-thread.
